{
   // DEMETRIUS LETTERS
   
   "DemetriusMail01.Title": "Carpenter Stock: Fiber and Moss",
   "DemetriusMail01.Text": "Farmer @,^How fares the farm after that peculiar downpour? Thankfully, it seems the rainwater proved harmless to human and animal life.^I get the feeling you're the curious sort, like me, so I imagine you went and had a look at its strange albeit beneficial effects on the plant life in the valley. My wife and I received quite the overgrowth, ourselves.^In fact, she asked that I let you know that she has some new materials in stock that a handy craftsman can find a lot of uses for. Feel free to come on down when you get the opportunity. Happy farming!^   -Demetrius",
   
   "MarlonMail01.Title": "Adventure Shop Stock: Foodstuffs",
   "MarlonMail01.Text": "Farmer @,^Good day. You show promise in both your combat skill and your dilligence in keeping the valley safe. You still have much to learn, greenhorn that you are, but know that you will have the guild behind you.^As you delve further into the mines below the mountain, you will use more and more energy on each trip. To assist new adventurers like yourself, the guild shop will start carrying refreshing snacks and light meals. We don't have a large kitchen with space to prepare full breakfasts and dinners, but we can offer these smaller provisions without issue.^   -Marlon",
   
   "RobinMail01.Title": "Carpenter Stock: Artisan Machines",
   "RobinMail02.Text": "Dear @,^I'm writing this to tell you that I've added a lot of new items to my stock, starting today!^Your talents as a farmer are out of this world. You're doing good by that old farm. My new list of products contains all sorts of items made to process artisan and animal goods.^You're in the big leagues, now! I'm sure you've thought of a production line, or maybe you've already started one! If you need help filling the space, come by and see what I can get you!^   Your friend,^   -Robin"
   
}